  lines:
  - time: 1.5
    duration: 3.2
    speaker: 
    color: {r: 0.8, g: 0.75, b: 0.9, a: 1}
    text: Somewhere in the Shattered Orbit, a small cargo ship limps home...
  - time: 5
    duration: 2
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: Six more hours and we're home.
  - time: 7.1
    duration: 1.2
    speaker: B
    color: {r: 0.36, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
    text: "Don't jinx it\u2014"
  - time: 8.6
    duration: 1.9
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: What was that?!
  - time: 10.7
    duration: 2.4
    speaker: B
    color: {r: 0.36, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
    text: "Engine core's overheating \u2014 we're losing thrust!"
  - time: 13.2
    duration: 2.6
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: There's a platform below. I'm bringing us down!
  - time: 16.1
    duration: 1.6
    speaker: B
    color: {r: 0.36, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
    text: Brace! Brace!
  - time: 20.2
    duration: 2.4
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: Everyone in one piece? ...Good.
  - time: 22.8
    duration: 2.8
    speaker: B
    color: {r: 0.36, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
    text: The core is fried. Help me pull it out before it blows.
  - time: 25.7
    duration: 1.6
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: "On three \u2014 pull!"
  - time: 27.4
    duration: 2.6
    speaker: B
    color: {r: 0.36, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
    text: "It split in two! Grab your half \u2014 we're not leaving it."
  - time: 30.2
    duration: 2.6
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: The scanner says that station can fix it. Across all that wreckage?
  - time: 32.9
    duration: 2
    speaker: B
    color: {r: 0.36, g: 0.88, b: 1, a: 1}
    text: You bend the gravity, I'll hold things still.
  - time: 35
    duration: 1.6
    speaker: A
    color: {r: 1, g: 0.62, b: 0.36, a: 1}
    text: Hold on to your half. Let's go.
